  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, linked-pile investigation): Axis-A (missing-flag) sibling of WI-soroz (catalog) and INV-jutuj (routes) within WI-gogif. All three target the same standardization: add --format text|json to read subcommands that currently emit text-only. Proposed payload for cache-status (per the item's own description): {cache_dir, entries: [{repo_id, size_bytes, age_days, entry_count}], total_size_bytes, total_entries, honk_threshold_gb}, wrapped with the shared schema_version/view envelope."  # 5f56
