  message: "Fixed + merged (selfh/dev 4d4cbefcae). cache-status gains --format json via add_schema_envelope: {cache_dir, total_entries, total_size_bytes, entries:[{fingerprint,size_bytes,entry_count,age_days}], honk_threshold_bytes}. Covers empty/populated/per-repo paths; --quiet still suppresses all output. Behavioral evidence: json-empty + json-with-entries tests; core 100%. cli-output sub-A."  # 3401
